Sval: Remove LaterRun and the address bar's search tips

LaterRun opened Mozilla's pages some sessions after a new profile or an
update, and was off. The search tips were Mozilla's onboarding rows in
the address bar, gated on a recommendation pref Sval locks off. Both go,
with their prefs, strings and tests. modules/libpref/Preferences.cpp
still names browser.laterrun.bookkeeping.profileCreationTime among the
prefs it sanitizes.

